(149,"Day 149 latency split?","guard_in p50 0.04 ms, llm p50 641.70 ms, tool p50 0.01 ms: the model is everything."),
(149,"Where did the assumed cost come from?","Input tokens, 85% (mean 421 in vs 24 out); cheapest fix is a shorter or cached prompt."),
(149,"Honest reading of 8/10 attacks blocked?","6 by the input regex, 2 were schema failures; the model never called send_email; 4 paraphrases evaded the regex."),
(149,"Which guard stops paraphrased injections?","The output guard: allow-list and approval for side-effect tools."),
(149,"Why redact PII before the model?","So it never enters prompts, logs or third-party APIs."),
(150,"Why was the capstone release blocked?","recall@3 0.53 < 0.60 and one notes question misrouted to tools by the word 'compute'."),
(150,"Why distrust iteration 2's recall@3 0.60?","256/64 chunking was chosen on the gate's own eval set."),
(150,"Per-query low-confidence flag result?","8% flagged in-domain and 8% for all-new topics: useless."),
(150,"Window PSI result on Day 150?","0.165 in-domain vs threshold 1.027; 1.491 half-new; 3.263 all-new."),
(150,"Out-of-scope behaviour on Day 150?","13 of 14 new-topic questions got confident wrong citations: needs an abstain path."),
